{"query_id": "dp-long-household-log", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The Saltings Cottage maintenance log records the following about the Peallby stove:\n\n- The installer wants the stove serviced again within 71 weeks, regardless of the glass condition [2].\n- The baffle plate cracked and was replaced on 2026-10-14 [3].\n- Logs must read under 41.6% moisture on the meter, or the glass blackens within a day [4].\n- After a reline, the stove needs 36 hours of slow burning before the door seal stops weeping [5].\n- A new carbon monoxide alarm was installed beside the stove, expiring on 2030-11-26 [6].", "answer_sha256": "aa9db48d2ec72c8374700ca64b69cf77dc963ec127c96a831a4b8e8f628850f3", "ranked_ids": ["household-log-long", "fragment-decoy-04"], "citation_map": {"1": "household-log-long", "10": "household-log-long", "11": "household-log-long", "12": "household-log-long", "13": "household-log-long", "14": "household-log-long", "15": "household-log-long", "16": "household-log-long", "17": "household-log-long", "18": "household-log-long", "19": "household-log-long", "2": "household-log-long", "20": "household-log-long", "21": "household-log-long", "22": "household-log-long", "23": "household-log-long", "24": "household-log-long", "25": "household-log-long", "26": "household-log-long", "27": "household-log-long", "28": "household-log-long", "29": "household-log-long", "3": "household-log-long", "30": "household-log-long", "31": "household-log-long", "32": "household-log-long", "33": "fragment-decoy-04", "34": "household-log-long", "4": "household-log-long", "5": "household-log-long", "6": "household-log-long", "7": "household-log-long", "8": "household-log-long", "9": "household-log-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "cited_document_ids": ["household-log-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": false, "answer_correct": null, "review_status": "unreviewed", "latency_