{"query_id": "dp-long-hall-transcript", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "At the village hall trustees' open meeting, Councillor Reallhollow made the following commitments:\n\n1.  **Kitchen funding:** He committed to contributing £6,497.92 from his ward budget towards the new kitchen, stating this was settled [2].\n2.  **Roof survey:** He promised to have the roof survey back to the trustees by 2026-01-15 [3].\n3.  **Repair cafe hours:** He agreed to give 58 hours a month to the repair cafe until they find a regular volunteer [5].\n4.  **Ramp completion:** He committed that the ramp at the side door would be finished before 2026-03-18 and stated he would chase the builder himself [6].\n5.  **Hall access during library closure:** He promised to keep the hall open late on Thursdays while the library is shut, for at least the next 82 calendar days [7].", "answer_sha256": "2d0cba9f665e71f35e403d609e17cb061b396bda2a14ba97f7a611f64dca2eff", "ranked_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "hall-transcript-long", "10": "hall-transcript-long", "11": "hall-transcript-long", "12": "hall-transcript-long", "13": "hall-transcript-long", "14": "hall-transcript-long", "15": "hall-transcript-long", "16": "hall-transcript-long", "2": "hall-transcript-long", "3": "hall-transcript-long", "4": "hall-transcript-long", "5": "hall-transcript-long", "6": "hall-transcript-long", "7": "hall-transcript-long", "8": "hall-transcript-long", "9": "hall-transcript-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 5, 6, 7], "cited_document_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": false, "answer_correct": null, "review_status": "unreviewed", "latency_ms": 84204, "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf", "error": null, "turn_scores": [{"turn": 0, "mechanical": {"missing_facts": [["66.6 per cent", "66.6%", "66.6 percent"]], "forbidden_claims": [], "cited_ids": [2, 3, 5, 6, 7], "invalid_citat