{"query_id": "dp-long-lab-notebook", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The soil lab notebook records the following details about the Throassmere core:\n\n*   A second core was taken at the site on 2025-01-10, labelled with a B suffix [2].\n*   The median grain size in the lower band is 0.0127 mm, which is silt rather than fine sand [1][3].\n*   In the hydrometer test, the fine fraction settled out at 0.0581 mm [6].\n*   The core needed 15 hours in the oven before its mass stopped changing between weighings [7].\n*   The moisture content after oven drying is 12.4 per cent [4].\n*   The organic matter content by loss on ignition is 57.5 per cent [5].", "answer_sha256": "1460ce8eb3ae369114acf070265801f297f207d102a3ec065d9bac6e19285057", "ranked_ids": ["lab-notebook-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "lab-notebook-long", "10": "lab-notebook-long", "11": "lab-notebook-long", "12": "lab-notebook-long", "13": "lab-notebook-long", "14": "lab-notebook-long", "15": "lab-notebook-long", "16": "lab-notebook-long", "17": "lab-notebook-long", "18": "lab-notebook-long", "19": "lab-notebook-long", "2": "lab-notebook-long", "20": "lab-notebook-long", "21": "lab-notebook-long", "22": "lab-notebook-long", "23": "lab-notebook-long", "24": "lab-notebook-long", "25": "lab-notebook-long", "26": "lab-notebook-long", "27": "lab-notebook-long", "28": "lab-notebook-long", "29": "lab-notebook-long", "3": "lab-notebook-long", "30": "lab-notebook-long", "31": "lab-notebook-long", "32": "lab-notebook-long", "4": "lab-notebook-long", "5": "lab-notebook-long", "6": "lab-notebook-long", "7": "lab-notebook-long", "8": "lab-notebook-long", "9": "lab-notebook-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 1, 3, 6, 7, 4, 5], "cited_document_ids": ["lab-notebook-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": true, "answer_correct": null, "review_status": "unreviewed", "latency_ms": 93394, "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf", "error": nu